 "You can Scrap a weapon at any time during crafting,which will destroy that weapon and restore allmetal and parts to your inventory.": "你可以在製作過程中隨時拆解武器，這會摧毀該武器並將所有金屬和零件恢復到你的庫存中。",
 "Drag both arms of the bow upwards to stretch the string.\nTry to make it straight to earn the maximum Power for a Bow.": "OK",
 "You need to Stretch this Bow.": "OK",
 "Drag one of your Grips onto the middle of the Bow.": "OK",
 "First drag an Arrowhead onto the arrow shaft.": "OK",
 "Line it up with arrow shaft\nto get maximum Durability!": "OK",
 "Build the Axe Head by attaching all three parts to the center. Drag each blade and spike, and release when it's against the center. Keep them straight to get maximum Power for an Axe.": "組裝斧頭，將所有三個部件連接到中心。拖曳每個刀刃和尖刺，當它們與中心對齊時鬆開。保持它們筆直，以獲得斧頭的最大威力。",
 "You need to Build the Handle for the Axe. First drag a Pole and drop it onto the axe. Keep it centered for maximum Durability, otherwise it will land crooked!": "OK",
 "Drag a Grip and Cap onto the axe to finish the handle.": "OK",
 "Choose a Paint to use on the shield.": "OK",
 "Click and drag along the shield to paint the surface. Cover the whole surface for maximum Power, and keep painting until the Paint Meter is empty!": "OK",
 "Place a Crest on a shield to finish it. Keep the crest centered for maximum Durability.": "OK",
 "Drag all of the Pegs onto the Mace head to attach them.": "OK",
 "Try to arrange them like the picture\non the right for maximum Power!": "OK",
 "You can build an Epic Weapon using the Design you found earlier! Click the Designs book to open it.": "OK",
 "All of the Epic Weapon Designs you find are shown here! Click the Bows icon to see your design.": "OK",
 "Click on the Design tab to\nsee the recipe for this weapon.": "OK",
 "You can see the parts needed\nto build this weapon, and a\nif you have the parts already.": "你可以看到製作此武器所需的材料，以及你是否已經擁有這些材料的標記。",
 "You can see the Bonus Effectthis weapon will give you here.": "OK",
 "You can Bookmark the parts to keep track of what you're saving or building.": "OK",
 "Parts that are Bookmarked will show this icon:": "OK",
 "When you craft great weapons and earn points on a weapon's\nStar Meter, you can unlock extra Elemental Boosts\nfor each weapon type!": "當你打造出優秀的武器，並在武器的星星計量條上獲得積分時，你可以解鎖每種武器型別的額外元素強化！",
 "Want to multitask?Click the Back button to take otherweapon orders and switch to other stations!": "OK",
 "Don't worry if you don't reach the\nTreasure Chest each day!": "OK",
 "The Design and parts will be available in\nother Treasure Chests during future battles.": "OK",
 "Message Goes Here": "OK",
 "Scouting and Orders": "OK",
 "As you travel down the road, many different enemies\nwill be blocking your path!": "OK",
 "Your sidekick Scout will run ahead, and let you know\nwhat kind of enemies you will have to face that day.": "OK",
 "Sometimes you will encounter Elemental Enemies that are weak against a certain Elemental Boost. Build weapons that deal extra elemental damage for these enemies!": "有時候你會遇到元素敵人，他們對特定的元素強化較弱。為這些敵人打造能造成額外元素傷害的武器吧！",
 "Soldiers in the area will help you, but they need weapons first!": "區域內的士兵會幫助你，但他們首先需要武器！",
 "Each soldier is skilled with a certain type of weapon.\nSwordsmen can only use swords,\nand archers can only use bows.": "OK",
 "Soldiers will wait until you craft a weapon, and will then join\nyou in battle at the end of the day.": "OK",
 "Craft Weapons": "OK",
 "Your wagon has four Crafting Stations where you can\nbuild a weapon. You can use any station -- and can use all\nof them at once when multitasking!": "OK",
 "You will unlock three different molds for each type of weapon.Soldiers can use any of the three variations, but eachof them has a different Elemental Boost!": "OK",
 "If you craft a great weapon, that mold's Star Meter\nwill begin to fill up. When the meter is filled, you will unlock\nextra Elemental Boosts for that weapon variation!": "OK",
 "Each type of weapon has a different process for crafting.\nAll weapons need to be forged using your collected metals,\nand some weapons share similar parts (like Grips).": "OK",
 "Stats": "OK",
 "Each weapon has two main stats:": "OK",
 "The Power and Durability for a weapon come from the metal\nyou use to create it. Better metals have higher stats.": "武器的威力和耐久度取決於你用來製造它的金屬。更好的金屬具有更高的屬性值。",
 "Parts that you collect or buy will also have additional\nStat Boosts, to make your weapon even stronger.": "你收集或購買的部件也會提供額外的屬性強化，讓你的武器更加強大。",
 "If you craft a weapon poorly, the stats will go down, and it\nwon't do as well in battle. Craft a great weapon to get the\nmaximum Power and Durability!": "如果你製作的武器品質不好，屬性值會下降，戰鬥表現也會變差。製作出色的武器，才能獲得最高的威力和耐久度！",
 "Power": "威力",
 "The weapon's attack strength": "OK",
 "Durability": "耐久度",
 "How long the weapon lasts before breaking": "OK",
 "If your overall Luck for your group of soldiers is high enough,\nenemies may drop more items and better metals!": "如果你士兵群體的整體幸運值足夠高，敵人可能會掉落更多的物品和更好的金屬！",
 "Some parts will have a Luck Stat:": "有些部件會帶有幸運屬性：",
 "Weapons and parts can also have Elemental Boostsin addition to their regular stats. Check the \"Element Chart\"section for more information.": "武器和部件除了常規屬性外，還可能擁有元素強化。請參閱「元素圖表」部分以獲取更多資訊。",
 "Shop": "商店",
 "Use the Gems you collect ( ) to buy\nweapon parts from Gander’s shop.": "OK",
 "New items are added each day, and old items are removed,\nso keep checking back to find that part you want!": "OK",
 "You can also buy some extra metal ore when it's in stock.": "OK",
 "Gander is a traveling salesman, so he can only carry\none of each part in stock each day.": "Gander 是一位巡迴商人，所以他每天每種部件僅能攜帶一個。",
 "Battle": "OK",
 "The soldiers go to battle using your weapons!\nHow well you built the weapons determines how well\nthey’ll perform in battle.": "OK",
 "Monsters will drop loot when attacked.\nMove your mouse over the dropped items to collect them!": "OK",
 "Each weapon’s Durability goes down when it’s used,\nand also goes down when an enemy attacks.\nWhen Durability reaches zero, the weapon will break\nand that soldier will retreat.": "OK",
 "You’ll earn Experience Points (XP) when a monster is defeated,\nand they spray extra loot down the trail.": "OK",
 "View the separate topics in the \"Battle\" section to learn\nmore details about the battle.": "OK",
 "Crafting Swords": "OK",
 "When your metal is melted, SLOWLY pull the chain downwards\nto pour it into the mold. If you pull too fast, the metal will\nspill and your sword won't form correctly!": "OK",
 "Don't leave your metal melting for too long! If it's overdone,\nthe metal will form cracks when it cools, and not be\nas durable in battle.": "OK",
 "You need to hammer a sword to sharpen its edges.\nClick along the edges of the sword to hammer.": "OK",
 "You can only swing the hammer a certain number of times,\nso try to space out your hammering to make it all the way\naround the blade!": "OK",
 "The Falchion only needs to be sharpened on one side,\nbut you can't swing the hammer as many times.": "OK",
 "If you hammer poorly, the sword won't have as much\nPower in battle. Hammer evenly around the edges to get\nthe maximum Power for your sword.": "OK",
 "You build the handle of a sword by dropping parts onto it.\nFirst drag and release a GUARD onto the sword's end,\nthen a GRIP, then a CAP.": "OK",
 "If you build the handle crooked, your sword won't have\nas much Durability in battle and will break quickly.\nLine up the parts correctly to get the maximum Durability.": "OK",
 "Crafting Bows": "OK",
 "You need to stretch a bow before a soldier can use it.\nDrag both \"arms\" of the bow upwards to stretch the string.\nTry to make it straight to earn the maximum Power for the bow.": "OK",
 "Drag one of your Grips onto the middle of the Bow.\nMany weapons use the same parts, like Grips.": "OK",
 "Drag an Arrowhead onto the arrow shaft.\nLine it up with the arrow shaft to keep it straight\nand get maximum Durability!": "OK",
 "Drag a Fletching onto the other end of the arrow shaft.": "OK",
 "Crafting Axes": "OK",
 "You need to build the Axe head by attaching all three parts\nto the center.": "OK",
 "Drag each blade and spike, and release when it's against\nthe center piece. Keep them straight to get maximum\nPower for the axe.": "OK",
 "Be sure to put each blade on the correct side! If you have it\non the wrong side, it will look crooked and won't line up\ncorrectly.": "OK",
 "You need to build the handle of the Axe using a Pole, Grip,\nand Cap.": "OK",
 "Keep each part centered when you drop it for maximum\nDurability. If it's not centered, it will land crooked, and\nwon't be as durable!": "OK",
 "Crafting Shields": "OK",
 "You first need to choose a paint to use on a Shield.\nSome paints will have extra Stat Boosts.": "OK",
 "Click and drag across the surface of the Shield to apply\nthe paint. Cover the whole surface of the Shield for\nmaximum Power!": "OK",
 "Keep dragging and painting until the \"Paint Meter\" above\nthe Shield is completely empty. Don't leave any blank spots!": "OK",
 "Place a Crest on a shield to finish it. Keep the Crest centered\nfor maximum Durability.": "OK",
 "Crafting Pikes": "OK",
 "You need to hammer a Pike blade just like a Sword blade.\nPike blades are shaped differently, so make sure you hammer\non the edges that look like they should be sharp!": "你需要像鍛造劍的刀刃一樣鍛造長槍的刀刃。長槍的刀刃形狀不同，所以請確保在看起來應該鋒利的邊緣上鍛造！",
 "You build a Pike handle just like an Axe handle, but it's\nmuch longer! You'll need to use more Poles and Grips\nto build one.": "你可以像製作斧柄一樣製作長槍的長柄，但它要長得多！你需要使用更多的長柄和握把來製作一支。",
 "Crafting Maces": "OK",
 "Drag all of the Pegs or Spikes onto the\nMace head to attach them.": "將所有的尖刺拖曳到錘頭上以固定它們。",
 "There is a picture showing how each Mace type should\nhave its spikes arranged. Try to make it look like\nthat picture!": "OK",
 "Arrange the spikes correctly for maximum Power!": "OK",
 "Be careful with the Battle Mace -- its spikes need to be\nattached differently than the other two!": "OK",
 "Element Chart": "OK",
 "How long a weapon lasts before breaking": "OK",
 "Luck": "OK",
 "Chance to make enemies drop more loot\nor better loot": "OK",
 "Fire": "OK",
 "Fire Boosts only deal extra damage to\nFire Enemies": "火強化只能對火敵人造成額外傷害",
 "Water": "OK",
 "Water Boosts only deal extra damage to\nWater Enemies": "水強化只能對水敵人造成額外傷害",
 "Ice": "OK",
 "Ice Boosts only deal extra damage to\nIce Enemies": "冰強化只能對冰敵人造成額外傷害",
 "Stone": "OK",
 "Stone Boosts only deal extra damage to\nStone Enemies": "OK",
 "Wind": "OK",
 "Wind Boosts only deal extra damage to\nWind Enemies": "風強化只能對風敵人造成額外傷害",
 "Lightning": "OK",
 "Lightning Boosts only deal extra damage to\nLightning Enemies": "OK",
 "Plant": "OK",
 "Plant Boosts only deal extra damage to\nPlant Enemies": "OK",
 "Shadow": "OK",
 "Shadow Boosts only deal extra damage to\nShadow Enemies": "OK",
 "(Basic)": "OK",
 "Symbol used when an enemy is not an\nElemental Enemy": "OK",
 "Weapon Parts": "OK",
 "Fire Boost +7": "火強化 +7",
 "Many parts will give Elemental Boosts to your weapons.": "OK",
 "You own 1 of these": "OK",
 "If you attach a part poorly, you may not get the full\nElemental Boost amount, so be careful!": "OK",
 "Used in an Epic Weapon Design\nthat you've collected in Battle": "OK",
 "Weapon Boosts": "武器強化",
 "Each weapon variation comes with different Elemental Boosts.": "每種武器變體都帶有不同的元素強化。",
 "If you make a great weapon, that variation's Star Meter\nwill start to fill up. When the meter is completely full,\nyou will unlock EXTRA Elemental Boosts for that\nweapon variation!": "如果你製作出優秀的武器，該變體的星星計量條就會開始填滿。當計量條完全滿時，你將會解鎖該武器變體的額外元素強化！",
 "Each variation starts with one Boost,\nand has three extra Boosts to unlock\n(Bronze, Silver, and Gold)": "每個變體一開始都帶有一個強化，並有三個額外的強化可供解鎖（青銅、銀、金）",
 "Longswords deal extra damage to Fire Enemies,\nand the Gladius deals extra damage to Water Enemies.": "長劍對火屬性敵人造成額外傷害，而 Gladius 對水屬性敵人造成額外傷害。",
 "These Elemental Boosts are added on top of the usual\nweapon Power and Durability.": "這些元素強化會疊加在武器原本的威力與耐久度之上。",
 "Battle Screen": "OK",
 "A: Soldiers' weapons and durability remaining\nB: Enemies on this trail\nC: Current enemy (highlighted)\nD: Enemy Health Bar\nE: Enemy Element\n(will flash when you deal Elemental Damage)\nF: Your cannonballs\nG: Recharging timer around a cannonball": "A：士兵的武器與剩餘耐久度 B：此道路上的敵人 C：當前敵人（高亮顯示） D：敵人血條 E：敵人屬性（造成元素傷害時會閃爍） F：你的砲彈 G：砲彈周圍的充能計時器",
 "Enemies": "OK",
 "In the Lowlands, you'll only see basic enemies.\nOnce you reach Cinder Springs and beyond, you'll start\nseeing stronger Elemental Enemies as well!": "OK",
 "Elemental Enemies are each weak against a certain Elemental Boost. Build weapons that deal extra elemental damage for these enemies!": "每個元素敵人都有特定的元素強化弱點。製作能對這些敵人造成額外元素傷害的武器吧！",
 "As you travel further, monsters will get larger and stronger!": "OK",
 "Check the \"Beasts\" Book to see all of the types of\nmonsters you've already encountered.": "查看「野獸」圖鑑，可以查看你已經遇到的所有怪物種類。",
 "Loot": "OK",
 "Enemies will drop loot every time a soldier attacks!\nMove your mouse over dropped loot to collect it.": "OK",
 "When you defeat an enemy, they'll spray extra loot down\nthe trail. This loot usually contains better metals and\nweapon parts.": "OK",
 "If you craft stronger weapons, enemies may drop\nbetter metal ores as loot! When you start crafting Bronze\nweapons, enemies will start dropping some Iron Ore.": "OK",
 "Use weapon parts with a Luck Boost ( ), and\nenemies will have a chance to drop more loot and\nbetter metal ores!": "OK",
 "Treasure": "OK",
 "If you defeat all of the enemies on a trail, you'll reach\na Treasure Chest that has special loot: An Epic Weapon Design\nand the parts required to build it!": "OK",
 "You won't always reach the Treasure Chest if your\nweapons break, so you won't always get a new Epic Weapon.": "OK",
 "Be sure to collect all of the parts that pour out of the\nTreasure Chest, including the Design Scroll!": "OK",
 "Don't worry if you don't reach the Treasure Chest each day!\nThe Design and parts in that Treasure Chest will be\navailable in other Treasure Chests during future battles.": "OK",
 "Cannon": "OK",
 "You will eventually unlock a Cannon for your wagon,\nso you can help your troops in battle!": "你最終會為你的馬車解鎖一個大砲，這樣你就可以在戰鬥中幫助你的部隊！",
 "Click on one of the Cannonball buttons to launch\na cannonball into the field.": "OK",
 "Large Widescreen": "OK",
 "After you use your cannon, it will need to recharge\nbefore you can fire that type of cannonball again.": "OK",
 "You will unlock some cannonballs that fire at\nyour troops instead of the enemy!\n\nThe Repair Bomb will repair some of\nthe durability on all of your weapons.\n\nThe Booster Bomb will give all of your soldiers a\nboosted attack power for a limited time!": "你將解鎖一些砲彈，它們會攻擊你的士兵，而不是敵人！「修理炸彈」會修復所有武器的部分耐久度。「增益炸彈」會暫時提升所有士兵的攻擊力！",
 "Some cannonballs will affect the enemies\ntemporarily!\n\nThe Fire Bomb will slowly deal damage to the enemy\nas the fire burns.\n\nThe Lightning Bomb will zap an enemy's attack\npower for a limited time, so you take less damage\nfrom their attacks.\n\nThe Ice Bomb will freeze an enemy in place for a limited\ntime, so they can't fight back!": "OK",
 "Finding and Browsing": "OK",
 "If you defeat all of the monsters on a trail, you'll reach a\nTreasure Chest that contains an Epic Weapon Design and the\nparts needed to build it. Be sure to collect everything\nthat drops out of the chest!": "OK",
 "Click the \"Designs\" book to browse through any\nWeapon Designs you've collected.\nYou can also press D on the keyboard, or go to the\nDesigns page from the MENU button.": "OK",
 "A: Tabs for different weapon types\nB: List of designs found for this weapon type\nC: Parts needed to build this weapon\nD: Bonus Effect given to soldiers when you build this\nE: Bookmark Button": "OK",
 "Design names will be shown in GREEN in the list if youcurrently have all of the parts and metals needed to build it.": "OK",
 "Design names will have a Star if you've built at least one\nof this Epic Weapon before.": "OK",
 "Bonus Effects": "OK",
 "Each Epic Weapon design gives a Bonus Effect to ALL\nof the soldiers on that day if you build one.": "每個史詩武器設計圖，如果你打造一件，就能為當天所有士兵提供額外效果。",
 "This Bonus Effect is added to each weapon's stats during\nthe battle.": "OK",
 "Need to face some Fire Enemies?\nTry building an Epic Weapon that gives a bonus\nFire Boost to all of your soldiers.": "OK",
 "Even if this weapon uses a low-quality metal, it may be even\nmore helpful to build it and gain the Fire Boost for everyone!": "OK",
 "Bookmarks": "OK",
 "You won't always have the parts needed to make one\nof your Epic Weapons.": "OK",
 "You can \"Bookmark\" a design's parts so you don't\naccidentally use them on a different weapon.": "OK",
 "Bookmarked parts will show a striped background and\nBookmark icon when you're building and browsing\nyour inventory:": "OK",
 "You can have multiple designs bookmarked at once,\nand you can remove a bookmark whenever you like.": "OK",
 "Bookmark ribbons will be colored to match the type\nof weapon that the part is needed for.": "OK",
 "Swords": "OK",
 "Bows": "OK",
 "Axes": "OK",
 "Shields": "OK",
 "Pikes": "OK",
 "Maces": "OK",
 "Molds will also show a Bookmark icon if they're bookmarked,\nand Metal Ores will show an icon and the amount needed.": "OK",
 "Any parts that are used in an Epic Weapon Design\nyou have collected, even if it isn't currently\nbookmarked, will also show this icon:": "OK",
 "After you craft an Epic Weapon, it will automatically\nremove that bookmark (if it was bookmarked).": "OK",
 "If a part is used in Epic Weapon Designs you have\ncollected, but you've already made those designs at\nleast once, it will instead show this icon:": "OK",
 "Use those small scroll symbols to decide if you want to save\na part to use in a Design later, or if something is safe\nto use in your current weapon.": "OK",
 "Saving": "OK",
 "After you start a game, your progress is automatically\nsaved after completing each battle!": "OK",
 "Your game progress is saved directly to your computer.": "OK",
 "If you are having trouble saving your progress, make sure\nyou have plenty of storage space available so there is room\nfor your game progress to be saved.": "OK",
 "App Settings": "OK",
 "You can change how the game is displayed on your computer\nwithin the App Settings screen.": "OK",
 "Press the button while playing to open App Settings.": "OK",
 "You can also press the Escape key on your keyboard to open\nthe App Settings screen at any time, and you can also find\nthe button on the title screen.": "OK",
 "You can change whether you want the game to appear\nFull Screen, and can change the window size between\nvarious widescreen and classic (square) sizes.": "OK",
 "If your computer is having issues where the game is\nrunning slowly, you can change the Graphics Quality to\nlower settings to improve performance.": "OK",
 "You can also display the game in smaller window sizes\nif you are having performance issues with how the game\nis running on your computer.": "OK",
 "There are options to mute the music, mute sound effects,\nchange master volume, and quit the app from this menu.": "OK",
 "Gameplay Settings": "OK",
 "You can adjust some gameplay settings\nfrom the SETTINGS menu.": "OK",
 "If you disable \"Screen Shake\", the screen will no longer\nshake when hammering weapons or during battle.": "OK",
 "When forging metals, the Pull Chain is tailored for easy\nmouse controls, especially when playing at full screen.": "OK",
 "If you'd like to make the chain follow your mouse exactly,\nor if you're using a touch screen, you can disable\nthe \"Easy-to-Drag Forge Chain\" option.": "OK",
